    "body": "PR #913 merged as a partial step (`Refs #900`, main bdf17d8a, PROCESS_VERSION 15): opt-in sccache in the gate and the lighter dev profile. This issue stays open because its targets are not met yet (`target/` at 57 % of baseline against a goal of half; warm build about 2.2x faster against a goal of 3x) and the warm-cache saving on a real gate has not been measured. `in-review` removed (no open PR). Further savings are being worked out on #919 and its sub-issues; Linux / macOS checks are #914 / #915.",
